C# language service of the runner (lib/analysis.js): Roslyn with the reference assemblies and the XML documentation of
.NET Framework 4.7.2, the API that Mono 6.8 (mcs, used for running and grading) offers, and C# 7.3.
Build: dotnet publish -c Release -o publish (the deploy adds -p:RestoreLockedMode=true)

